  "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/matthart1983/netwatch/tarball/v0.40.1",
  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/matthart1983/netwatch/zipball/v0.40.1",
  "body": "## What's Changed\n* feat(daemon): flow log of which process connected where (experimental) by @matthart1983 in https://github.com/matthart1983/netwatch/pull/181\n* feat(macos): build an unsigned .dmg installer for Apple Silicon by @matthart1983 in https://github.com/matthart1983/netwatch/pull/182\n* ci(release): make release candidates, and check installs from every channel by @matthart1983 in https://github.com/matthart1983/netwatch/pull/183\n* README: trim header badges, fix Related by @matthart1983 in https://github.com/matthart1983/netwatch/pull/186\n* feat(uptime): --md report for an ISP ticket, and a second internet target by @matthart1983 in https://github.com/matthart1983/netwatch/pull/184\n* fix(theme): darken graph peaks on a light background by @matthart1983 in https://github.com/matthart1983/netwatch/pull/185\n* fix(health): don't ask the second internet target behind a silent gateway by @matthart1983 in https://github.com/matthart1983/netwatch/pull/187\n* README: light-terminal demo at the top; re-record the dark demo on 0.40.0 by @matthart1983 in https://github.com/matthart1983/netwatch/pull/188\n* Record the light demo in the paper theme by @matthart1983 in https://github.com/matthart1983/netwatch/pull/189\n* docs(performance): record the plateau gate exception for 1.0.0-rc.1 by @matthart1983 in https://github.com/matthart1983/netwatch/pull/190\n* fix(sandbox): accept a denied TCP Fast Open send in the gap test (#192) by @matthart1983 in https://github.com/matthart1983/netwatch/pull/196\n* fix(release): name pre-release packages as GitHub serves them, and keep :latest off them by @matthart1983 in https://github.com/matthart1983/netwatch/pull/191\n* fix(memory): turn transparent huge pages off at startup on Linux by @matthart1983 in https://github.com/matthart1983/netwatch/pull/198\n* fix(platform): stop the capture fix line when netwatch isn't on PATH by @matthart1983 in https://github.com/matthart1983/netwatch/pull/199\n* README: lead with what netwatch does and show Diagnose closing an issue by @matthart1983 in https://github.com/matthart1983/netwatch/pull/201\n* Diagnose: rule maturity, earned verdicts, and the tools to prove them by @matthart1983 in https://github.com/matthart1983/netwatch/pull/203\n* windows: fix the unit-test binary crashing at startup on Rust 1.100 by @matthart1983 in https://github.com/matthart1983/netwatch/pull/205\n* build(deps): bump the cargo-minor group with 4 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/matthart1983/netwatch/pull/193\n* build(deps): bump taiki-e/install-action from 2.88.0 to 2.90.1 in the actions group by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/matthart1983/netwatch/pull/195\n* TUI: layouts that fit every size, a command palette, and one look across tabs by @matthart1983 in https://github.com/matthart1983/netwatch/pull/204\n* Packet filters take CIDR ranges and != by @matthart1983 in https://github.com/matthart1983/netwatch/pull/206\n* build(deps): bump jsonschema from 0.20.0 to 0.60.2 by @matthart1983 in https://github.com/matthart1983/netwatch/pull/207\n* build(deps): bump the actions group with 5 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/matthart1983/netwatch/pull/210\n* build(deps): bump the cargo-minor group with 5 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/matthart1983/netwatch/pull/208\n* build(deps): bump jsonschema from 0.60.2 to 0.61.1 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/matthart1983/netwatch/pull/209\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/matthart1983/netwatch/compare/v0.40.0...v0.40.1",
